# Extraction Integrant's granted trigger (CR 603.2, 611.2): every creature declared as blocking it gets -1/-1 until end of
# turn, so both of Bot2's 3/3 blockers are exactly 2/2 once the blockers are declared, while the Integrant is blocked by
# the two of them (menace, CR 702.111) and dies to their 4 damage. The Integrant is paid for with exactly its two Swamps.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Extraction Integrant
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Forest
Kalonian Tusker
Kalonian Tusker
Forest x12

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Kalonian Tusker.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Kalonian Tusker.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Extraction Integrant.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
[T5 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Extraction Integrant > Bot2)
Bot2.Block(Kalonian Tusker > Extraction Integrant; Kalonian Tusker#2 > Extraction Integrant)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Kalonian Tusker#1.Power = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Kalonian Tusker#1.Toughness = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Kalonian Tusker#2.Power = 2
? Bot2.Battlefield.Kalonian Tusker#2.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot2.Life = 20
